title: "private-security-workforce: official counts of private security guards by country, with police where the same source counts both"
abstract: "Official counts of private security guards in the United States (2014-2025), Japan (2007-2025), South Africa (2011-2023), the United Kingdom (2004-2026) and Australia (1986-2026), from each government's own records, with police counts and guards per police officer where the same source counts both."
